<field name="CLASS_NAME">PinpointBlocks</field>
<field name="METHOD_NAME">resetPosAndIMU</field>
<comment pinned="false" h="80" w="160">Resets the current position to 0,0,0 and recalibrates the Odometry Computer's internal IMU. Robot MUST Be stationary. Device takes a large number of samples, and uses those as the gyroscope zero-offset. This takes approximately 0.25 seconds.</comment>
